  "description": "*“Let's make a deal!”*\n\nJi-An, CEO of a perfume company, has lived her entire life focused solely on scent. After a car accident, she suffers inexplicable loss of smell, bringing her entire life to a halt. But then, she senses a fragrance only from a man she encounters by chance on the street. Han Do-Yun...?! To find the reason, Ji-An proposes a contract to him.\n\nA fragrant romance that begins with a chance encounter!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
